{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "dependence-formed-from-drawing",
  "title": {
    "en": "A dependence formed from drawing",
    "zh": "来自汲取的依存"
  },
  "kind": "theorem",
  "status": "recorded-checked",
  "family": "F01",
  "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-10-22T14:52:46+00:00",
  "statement": {
    "en": "Where depending and drawing part at the giver, under the reading of drawing a dependence forms anew at a descent exactly where the giver drew on what it did not depend on: a dependence formed by descent is a giver's drawing become its descendant's dependence.",
    "zh": "给予者处依存与汲取相分时，在汲取之读法下，依存恰在给予者汲取其所不依存者之处于世系中新结：世系形成的依存即给予者的汲取成为其后代的依存。"
  },
  "laws": [
    {
      "en": "At a descent where the descendant depends on a condition, the giver's holding alone decides inheritance against forming anew; the giver held it and drew on it, held it only, drew on it only, or neither.",
      "zh": "在后代依于某条件的世系处，只有给予者是否持有决定继承还是新结；给予者持有并汲取、只持有、只汲取，或皆无。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Web.inheritsAt_iff_held",
        "Becoming.Web.four_cases",
        "Becoming.Web.formsAnew_iff_drawn_or_neither"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Under the reading of drawing at the descent the case of neither is excluded, so a dependence forms anew exactly where the giver drew on what it did not depend on; with drawing depending as well, nothing forms anew.",
      "zh": "在该世系处的汲取之读法下，皆无的情形被排除，故依存恰在给予者汲取其所不依存者之处新结；汲取亦为依存时，无物新结。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Web.DependsOnDrawnAt",
        "Becoming.Web.DependsOnDrawnAt.not_undrawn",
        "Becoming.Web.formsAnew_iff_drawn_unheld",
        "Becoming.Web.formsAnew_iff_neither",
        "Becoming.Web.DependsOnDrawnAt.not_formsAnew",
        "Becoming.Web.dependsOnDrawnAt_iff"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "For the flow, the reading of drawing is passing on what is drawn with forming from drawing, and under balance a relatum coming to stand depends only on what some giver drew on.",
      "zh": "对流而言，汲取之读法即传递所汲者加上自汲取结成，在平衡下首立的关系者只依于某一给予者所汲者。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Flow.dependsOnDrawn_iff_at",
        "Becoming.Flow.FormsFromDrawn",
        "Becoming.Flow.dependsOnDrawn_iff_split",
        "Becoming.Flow.Inherits.formsFromDrawn",
        "Becoming.Flow.DependsOnDrawn.formsAnew",
        "Becoming.Flow.drawn_by_giver",
        "Becoming.Flow.formed_from_drawing",
        "Becoming.Flow.no_dependence_undrawn",
        "Becoming.Flow.DependsOnDrawn.none_formsAnew"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Witnesses: a parent drawing on food it does not depend on, its child coming to depend on it; a dependence formed from nothing drawn where the reading fails; a dependence passed on without drawing.",
      "zh": "见证：亲代汲取其所不依存的食物，子代开始依于它；读法不成立处自无所汲者结成的依存；不经汲取而传递的依存。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.World.droppedHatch_formed",
        "Becoming.World.novel_formed_undrawn",
        "Becoming.TwoGivers.passed_undrawn"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "en": "No axiom. The reading of drawing at the descent as a hypothesis; balance at the relatum coming to stand for the flow laws; decidability only for the case splits.",
      "zh": "不加公理。该世系处的汲取之读法作为假设；流的定律需首立之关系者处平衡；只有分情形需可判定。"
    }
  ],
  "does_not_show": [
    {
      "en": "Why a descendant comes to depend on what its giver drew on: the law says where a new dependence comes from.",
      "zh": "后代为何依于其给予者所汲者：此律说的是新依存从何而来。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "That the reading of drawing holds in any actual descent.",
      "zh": "汲取之读法在任何实际世系中成立。",
      "kind": "scope"
    }
  ],
